T_{h}=T/T_{eff}=1.32K(l,Y_{He},g)\\Lambda_{*}^{-4/5},  where

K(l,Y_{He},g)=l^{3/20}(1-5Y_{He}/8)^{2/15}(1-Y_{He}/2)^{-1/60}(1-l)^{-2/15}g_{1 4}^{1/60},

\\Lambda_{*}=0.14\\ln(8a)+0.1\\exp{(-5.5a)}+0.6\\,,\\,\\,a=K^{15/2}(l,Y_{He},g) and g_{14}=g/10^{14}cm s{}^{-2}.

The radiative transfer equation in the l\\sim 1 case also admits a semi-analytical treatment, which is presented in detail in ST02. Here we present the final results, obtained for the color factor T_{h} and color temperature kT

